  "cleanText": "Solution home \n\t\tPractice Management \n\t\tPractice Management Help Guide\n\n### Assign Services to Clients \n\n\t\t\tPrint\n\n\tModified on: Fri, 16 Jul, 2021 at  3:34 PM\n\n\t\tLocation: Practice Management module > Settings > Services > Assign Services\n\nRefer to the link\n\nClick here to watch how to assign Services to your clients\n\nHelp/Guide:\n\nServices can be assigned to clients in bulk using the Assign Services feature and is a per-requisite to creating deadlines in Practice Management\n\nTo assign Services to clients;\n\nNavigate to Settings > Services and click on Assign Services as shown below\n\n### \n\n### Assigning \n\nIn this page, you will find a grid view of all clients on the left and all clients above, simply tick the checkbox(s) to assign various services to your clients in bulk.\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDid you find it helpful?\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tYes\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tNo\n\nSend feedback\tSorry we couldn't be helpful. Help us improve this article with your feedback.",
  "bodyHtml": "\n\t<div class=\"breadcrumb\">\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions\"> Solution home </a>\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions/9000115348\">Practice Management </a>\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions/folders/9000188563\">Practice Management Help Guide</a>\n\t</div>\n\t<b class=\"page-stamp page-stamp-article\">\n\t\t<b class=\"icon-page-article\"></b>\n\t</b>\n\n\t<h2 class=\"heading\">Assign Services to Clients \n\t \t<a href=\"#\"\n            class=\"solution-print--icon print--remove\"\n \t\t\ttitle=\"Print this Article\"\n \t\t\tarial-role=\"link\"\n \t\t\tarial-label=\"Print this Article\"\n\t\t\tid=\"print-article\"\n \t\t>\n\t\t\t<span class=\"icon-print\"></span>\n\t\t\t<span class=\"text-print\">Print</span>\n \t\t</a>\n\t</h2>\n\t\n\t<p>Modified on: Fri, 16 Jul, 2021 at  3:34 PM</p>\n\t<hr />\n\t\n\n\t<article class=\"article-body\" id=\"article-body\" rel=\"image-enlarge\">\n\t\t<p dir=\"ltr\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">Location:</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">&nbsp;Practice Management module &gt; Settings &gt; Services &gt; Assign Services<br></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><a href=\"https://appv4.capium.com/#/settings\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\">Refer to the link</span></a></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><br></span><a href=\"https://www.loom.com/share/227f82cd39b04ba3a6a4a382e827da47\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\">Click here to watch how to assign Services to your clients</span></a></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><strong>Help/Guide:</strong></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><strong>Services can be assigned to clients in bulk using the Assign Services feature and is a per-requisite to creating deadlines in Practice Management<br></strong></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><strong>To assign Services to clients;</strong></span></p><ul><li dir=\"ltr\"><p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Navigate to Settings &gt; Services and click on Assign Services as shown below<br></span></p></li></ul><p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><br></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9112890504/original/qlnWKjJ1A1OluBlKDgj_YpF3Yr2p-HGDNw.png?1602071092\" style=\"width: auto;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"9112890504\"></span></p><h4 dir=\"ltr\"><br></h4><h4 dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><strong>Assigning&nbsp;</strong><br></span></h4><p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">In this page, you will find a grid view of all clients on the left and all clients above, simply tick the checkbox(s) to assign various services to your clients in bulk.<br></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9112890558/original/LPKZB4MUu-tOSM5cRgBGn9Utel9JS0pdcA.png?1602071125\" style=\"width: auto;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"9112890558\"></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><br></span><br></p>\n\t</article>\n\n\t<hr />\t\n\t\t\n\n\t\t<p class=\"article-vote\" id=\"voting-container\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-user-id=\"\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-article-id=\"9000165770\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-language=\"en\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDid you find it helpful?<span data-href=\"/support/solutions/articles/9000165770/thumbs_up\" class=\"vote-up a-link\" id=\"article_thumbs_up\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-remote=\"true\" data-method=\"put\" data-update=\"#voting-container\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-user-id=\"\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-